    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6852" root="حب" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبَبٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبَابٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, (S, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِبَبٌ</span></b> ,
(K,) <i>A beautiful arrangement of the teeth in
regular rows.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>Streaks of saliva
on the teeth.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  And (both accord. to the
K, but the latter only accord. to the TA,) The
<i>saliva that flows over the teeth,</i> or <i>collects in the
mouth, in little bubbles.</i> (T, K, TA.)

